---
import GovLayout from '../layouts/GovLayout.astro';
---
<GovLayout title="회계 첨부파일 운영 | 대한불교밀교종">
  <div class="file-admin" data-app data-accounting-files-ui-version="2026-08-16-v78-brand-wordmark" hidden>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a href="/accounting-files/" class="brand" aria-label="대한불교밀교종 회계 첨부파일 운영 홈"><img src="/brand-logo-transparent.png" alt="대한불교밀교종 로고" /><span class="brand-title"><img src="/brand-wordmark-symbol.svg" alt="대한불교밀교종" /><span class="brand-system-name">회계 첨부파일 운영</span></span></a>
      <div class="top-actions"><span data-user-label></span><a href="/" class="btn">전자문서</a><a href="/accounting/" class="btn">기본 회계</a><a href="/accounting-special/" class="btn">특화 회계</a><a href="/accounting-compliance/" class="btn">규정·공공조달</a><a href="/accounting-tax/" class="btn">세무·신고자료</a></div>
    </header>
    <main>
      <div class="notice" data-notice hidden></div>
      <section class="heading"><div><p>ACCOUNTING FILE OPERATIONS</p><h1>첨부파일 운영·무결성 관리</h1><span>D1 메타정보와 R2 실제 파일을 점검하고 오류 작업을 안전하게 재처리합니다.</span></div></section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="card-head"><div><h2>첨부파일 운영정책</h2><p>정책 변경은 새로 등록되는 파일부터 적용됩니다. 기존 파일의 보존기한은 자동 변경하지 않습니다.</p></div><span class="badge" data-mode-label></span></div>
        <form data-policy-form>
          <div class="form-grid three">
            <label class="span-2">허용 확장자<input name="allowedExtensions" placeholder="pdf,jpg,jpeg,png,hwp,hwpx,doc,docx,xls,xlsx,csv,txt" /></label>
            <label>파일당 최대용량(MB)<input name="maxFileMb" type="number" min="1" max="25" /></label>
            <label>건당 첨부 개수<input name="maxFiles" type="number" min="1" max="50" /></label>
            <label>건당 총용량(MB)<input name="maxTotalMb" type="number" min="1" max="200" /></label>
            <label>보존기간(일)<input name="retentionDays" type="number" min="1" max="36500" /></label>
            <label class="check policy-check"><input name="requireDeleteReason" type="checkbox" /> 삭제 사유 필수</label>
          </div>
          <div class="actions policy-actions"><button class="btn primary" type="submit" data-save-policy>운영정책 저장</button></div>
        </form>
        <p class="security-note">현재 악성파일 대응은 확장자·파일 시그니처·크기 검증과 실행형 파일 차단까지 적용합니다. 백신 엔진 기반 정밀검사는 별도 보안서비스 연계가 필요합니다.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="card-head"><div><h2>D1·R2 무결성 점검</h2><p>불일치를 발견해도 자동 삭제하지 않고 아래 관리자 점검목록에 먼저 표시합니다.</p></div><div class="actions"><button class="btn" type="button" data-scan="d1">D1 기준 빠른점검</button><button class="btn primary" type="button" data-scan="full">D1·R2 전체점검</button></div></div>
        <div class="summary" data-scan-summary><span>점검을 실행하면 결과가 표시됩니다.</span></div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="card-head"><div><h2>관리자 점검목록</h2><p>R2 단독 파일과 D1 단독 메타정보를 검토한 뒤 처리합니다.</p></div><div class="actions list-toolbar"><select data-issue-status><option value="open">점검 필요</option><option value="ignored">예외 승인</option><option value="resolved">처리 완료</option></select><button class="btn" type="button" data-load-issues>새로고침</button></div></div>
        <div class="table-wrap"><table class="admin-data-table"><thead><tr><th>유형</th><th>업무</th><th>파일·객체</th><th>최초 발견</th><th>최근 확인</th><th>상태</th><th>처리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-issue-rows><tr><td colspan="7" class="empty">점검목록을 불러오는 중입니다.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      </section>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="card-head"><div><h2>첨부파일 오류 재처리</h2><p>R2 삭제 실패 또는 보상삭제 실패 작업을 다시 처리합니다.</p></div><div class="actions list-toolbar"><select data-operation-status><option value="failed">재처리 필요</option><option value="succeeded">처리 완료</option></select><button class="btn" type="button" data-load-operations>새로고침</button></div></div>
        <div class="table-wrap"><table class="admin-data-table"><thead><tr><th>작업</th><th>업무</th><th>객체경로</th><th>시도</th><th>최근 오류</th><th>갱신일</th><th>처리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-operation-rows><tr><td colspan="7" class="empty">오류목록을 불러오는 중입니다.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
      </section>


      <section class="card reset-card">
        <div class="card-head"><div><h2>테스트자료 일괄 초기화</h2><p>전자문서·대장·증명서·기본 회계자료뿐 아니라 실무관리, 세무·신고자료, 수익사업·공공조달·준비금·회계점검·즉시보고·업무용 차량 자료와 관련 번호·로그까지 현행 기능 기준으로 한 번에 정리합니다.</p></div><span class="badge danger-badge">최고관리자 전용</span></div>
        <div class="reset-warning" role="note" aria-label="테스트자료 초기화 주의사항">
          <b class="reset-warning-label">주의:</b>
          <div class="reset-warning-lines">
            <p>운영자료가 포함된 상태에서는 실행하면 안 됩니다. 사용자·권한·로그인 세션, 전자문서 기본서식, 종단 설정, 회계연도, 기본 계정과목·회계구분·재원·종단 본부, 첨부 운영정책은 보존됩니다.</p>
            <p>D1·R2의 업무자료·세무 제출흔적·규정대응 자료·감사이력·첨부 작업기록·번호흔적은 삭제되지만 Cloudflare 플랫폼의 배포·접속 로그는 이 기능의 삭제 범위가 아닙니다.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="actions reset-preview-actions"><button class="btn" type="button" data-preview-test-reset>삭제 대상 미리보기</button></div>
        <div class="reset-preview" data-test-reset-preview hidden></div>
        <div class="reset-confirm-box">
          <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" data-reset-backup-confirm /> D1·R2 백업을 완료했습니다.</label>
          <label>확인문구<input type="text" data-reset-confirmation autocomplete="off" placeholder="테스트자료 전체삭제" /></label>
          <div class="actions reset-execute-actions"><button class="btn danger" type="button" data-execute-test-reset disabled>테스트자료 전체삭제·번호초기화</button></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="card guide">
        <h2>운영 원칙</h2>
        <div class="guide-grid"><div><b>1. 자동삭제 금지</b><span>고아 파일은 관리자 검토 후 정리합니다.</span></div><div><b>2. 감사계정 읽기 전용</b><span>감사계정은 정책·목록을 조회만 할 수 있습니다.</span></div><div><b>3. 오류 재처리</b><span>실패 작업은 이력과 오류를 남기고 다시 처리합니다.</span></div><div><b>4. 정기 복구훈련</b><span>백업은 생성뿐 아니라 복원시험까지 완료해야 합니다.</span></div></div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    (()=>{
      'use strict';
      const STORAGE_KEY='milgyo-system-session';
      const session=(()=>{try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY)||'null')}catch{return null}})();
      if(!session?.token||!session?.user){location.replace('/');return;}
      const token=session.token,me=session.user;
      const $=(selector,root=document)=>root.querySelector(selector),$$=(selector,root=document)=>Array.from(root.querySelectorAll(selector));
      const esc=(value)=>String(value??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,(character)=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[character]));
      const api=async(body)=>{const response=await fetch('/api/accounting/attachment-admin',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({...body,token})});const text=await response.text();let data;try{data=JSON.parse(text)}catch{data={ok:false,message:`서버 응답 오류(HTTP ${response.status})`}}if(!data.ok)throw new Error(data.message||'처리 중 오류가 발생했습니다.');return data;};
      const notice=(message,type='ok')=>{const el=$('[data-notice]');el.textContent=message;el.className=`notice ${type}`;el.hidden=false;clearTimeout(notice.timer);notice.timer=setTimeout(()=>el.hidden=true,5000);};
      const typeLabel=(value)=>({D1_ONLY:'D1 정보만 존재',R2_ONLY:'R2 파일만 존재',attachment_delete:'R2 첨부삭제',compensation_delete:'R2 보상삭제'}[value]||value||'-');
      const refLabel=(value)=>({resolution:'결의서',journal:'전표',donation:'기부금',receipt:'기부금영수증',asset:'자산·비품',card:'법인카드',card_transaction:'카드 사용내역',branch_report:'취합자료',closing:'결산·마감',budget:'예산',revenue_business:'수익사업',procurement_review:'입찰참가 검토',procurement_guarantee:'보증·하자보수',purpose_reserve:'고유목적사업준비금',compliance_check:'회계점검',finance_incident:'중요 회계사항 보고',vehicle:'업무용 차량'}[value]||value||'-');
      let permissions={manager:false,audit:false};
      let testResetPreviewLoaded=false;
      const TEST_RESET_CONFIRMATION='테스트자료 전체삭제';
      $('[data-user-label]').textContent=`${me.name} · ${me.position||'구성원'}`;

      const loadPolicy=async()=>{const data=await api({action:'policy'});permissions=data.permissions||{};const p=data.policy||{};const form=$('[data-policy-form]');form.allowedExtensions.value=(p.allowedExtensions||[]).join(',');form.maxFileMb.value=Math.round(Number(p.maxFileBytes||0)/1024/1024);form.maxFiles.value=p.maxFilesPerReference||10;form.maxTotalMb.value=Math.round(Number(p.maxTotalBytesPerReference||0)/1024/1024);form.retentionDays.value=p.retentionDays||3650;form.requireDeleteReason.checked=!!p.requireDeleteReason;$('[data-mode-label]').textContent=permissions.audit?'감사 읽기 전용':permissions.manager?'관리자':'조회 전용';$$('[data-save-policy],[data-scan]').forEach((button)=>button.disabled=!permissions.manager||permissions.audit);$('[data-preview-test-reset]').disabled=me.role!=='admin'||permissions.audit;$('[data-reset-backup-confirm]').disabled=me.role!=='admin'||permissions.audit;$('[data-reset-confirmation]').disabled=me.role!=='admin'||permissions.audit;if(!permissions.manager&&!permissions.audit){notice('첨부파일 운영화면은 회계관리자 또는 감사계정만 사용할 수 있습니다.','error');setTimeout(()=>location.replace('/accounting/'),1400);}};
      $('[data-policy-form]').addEventListener('submit',async(event)=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget;try{const data=await api({action:'save-policy',allowedExtensions:form.allowedExtensions.value,maxFileBytes:Number(form.maxFileMb.value)*1024*1024,maxFilesPerReference:Number(form.maxFiles.value),maxTotalBytesPerReference:Number(form.maxTotalMb.value)*1024*1024,retentionDays:Number(form.retentionDays.value),requireDeleteReason:form.requireDeleteReason.checked});notice(data.message);await loadPolicy();}catch(error){notice(error.message,'error');}});
      $$('[data-scan]').forEach((button)=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{button.disabled=true;try{const data=await api({action:'scan-integrity',mode:button.dataset.scan});const r=data.result||{};$('[data-scan-summary]').innerHTML=`<span>점검시각 <b>${esc(r.checkedAt||'-')}</b></span><span>활성 메타정보 <b>${Number(r.scannedAttachments||0)}건</b></span><span>D1만 존재 <b>${Number(r.d1Only||0)}건</b></span><span>R2만 존재 <b>${Number(r.r2Only||0)}건</b></span>${r.truncated?'<span class="warn">R2 객체가 많아 일부만 점검됨</span>':''}`;notice(data.message);await loadIssues();}catch(error){notice(error.message,'error');}finally{button.disabled=!permissions.manager||permissions.audit;}}));

      const loadIssues=async()=>{try{const data=await api({action:'issues',status:$('[data-issue-status]').value});const rows=data.rows||[];$('[data-issue-rows]').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map((row)=>{const file=row.details?.originalFilename||row.object_key;const actions=row.status==='open'&&permissions.manager&&!permissions.audit?(row.issue_type==='R2_ONLY'?`<button class="mini danger" data-resolve-issue="${esc(row.id)}" data-resolution="delete-r2">R2 삭제</button>`:`<button class="mini danger" data-resolve-issue="${esc(row.id)}" data-resolution="mark-d1-deleted">D1 기록 정리</button>`)+`<button class="mini" data-resolve-issue="${esc(row.id)}" data-resolution="ignore">예외 승인</button>`:'-';return `<tr><td class="cell-center">${esc(typeLabel(row.issue_type))}</td><td class="cell-center">${esc(refLabel(row.reference_type))}<small>${esc(row.reference_id||'-')}</small></td><td class="path cell-center">${esc(file)}</td><td class="cell-center">${esc(row.detected_at||'-')}</td><td class="cell-center">${esc(row.last_seen_at||'-')}</td><td class="cell-center">${esc(row.status)}</td><td class="cell-center"><div class="row-actions">${actions}</div></td></tr>`}).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="7" class="empty">해당 상태의 점검항목이 없습니다.</td></tr>';$$('[data-resolve-issue]').forEach((button)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>resolveIssue(button)));}catch(error){notice(error.message,'error');}};
      const resolveIssue=async(button)=>{const resolution=button.dataset.resolution;const message=resolution==='delete-r2'?'D1 정보가 없는 R2 객체를 삭제하시겠습니까?':resolution==='mark-d1-deleted'?'R2 파일이 없는 D1 메타정보를 삭제 상태로 정리하시겠습니까?':'해당 항목을 예외로 승인하시겠습니까?';if(!confirm(message))return;try{const data=await api({action:'resolve-issue',issueId:button.dataset.resolveIssue,resolution});notice(data.message);await loadIssues();}catch(error){notice(error.message,'error');}};

      const loadOperations=async()=>{try{const data=await api({action:'operations',status:$('[data-operation-status]').value});const rows=data.rows||[];$('[data-operation-rows]').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map((row)=>`<tr><td class="cell-center">${esc(typeLabel(row.operation_type))}</td><td class="cell-center">${esc(refLabel(row.reference_type))}<small>${esc(row.reference_id||'-')}</small></td><td class="path cell-center">${esc(row.object_key)}</td><td class="cell-center">${Number(row.attempts||0)}회</td><td class="cell-center">${esc(row.last_error||'-')}</td><td class="cell-center">${esc(row.updated_at||'-')}</td><td class="cell-center">${row.status==='failed'&&permissions.manager&&!permissions.audit?`<button class="mini" data-retry-operation="${esc(row.id)}">다시 처리</button>`:'-'}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="7" class="empty">해당 상태의 작업이 없습니다.</td></tr>';$$('[data-retry-operation]').forEach((button)=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>retryOperation(button)));}catch(error){notice(error.message,'error');}};
      const retryOperation=async(button)=>{if(!confirm('선택한 첨부파일 작업을 다시 처리하시겠습니까?'))return;try{const data=await api({action:'retry-operation',operationId:button.dataset.retryOperation});notice(data.message);await loadOperations();}catch(error){notice(error.message,'error');}};
      const formatResetPreview=(preview)=>{const main=preview.main||{},accounting=preview.accounting||{},traces=preview.traces||{};const metric=(label,value,unit='건')=>`<span class="reset-metric"><span>${esc(label)}</span><b>${Number(value||0).toLocaleString()}${esc(unit)}</b></span>`;const group=(title,tone,items)=>`<section class="reset-preview-row ${tone}"><h3>${esc(title)}</h3><div class="reset-metrics">${items.join('')}</div></section>`;return `<div class="reset-summary-list">${group('전자문서·대장·증명서','main',[metric('기안문서',main.documents),metric('접수·발송대장',main.receivedDocuments),metric('전자문서 첨부',main.attachments),metric('대장 신청',main.registers),metric('대장 첨부',main.registerAttachments),metric('재직증명서',main.employmentCertificates),metric('수계증서',main.ordinationCertificates),metric('임직원 추가정보',main.employeeProfiles),metric('R2',main.r2Objects,'개')])}${group('회계자료','accounting',[metric('결의',accounting.resolutions),metric('전표',accounting.journals),metric('기부',accounting.donations),metric('후원자',accounting.donors),metric('자산',accounting.assets),metric('카드·사용내역',Number(accounting.cards||0)+Number(accounting.cardTransactions||0)),metric('취합',accounting.branchReports),metric('증명원',accounting.certificates)])}${group('실무관리 등록자료','operations',[metric('대사계좌·가져오기',Number(accounting.bankAccounts||0)+Number(accounting.importBatches||0)+Number(accounting.importTransactions||0)),metric('자동분류·월대사',Number(accounting.matchingRules||0)+Number(accounting.reconciliations||0)),metric('예산변경·버전',Number(accounting.budgetChanges||0)+Number(accounting.budgetVersions||0)),metric('거래처·계좌변경',Number(accounting.vendors||0)+Number(accounting.vendorBankChanges||0)),metric('계약·지급',Number(accounting.contracts||0)+Number(accounting.contractPayments||0)),metric('기부금 일괄처리',Number(accounting.donationExportBatches||0)+Number(accounting.donationExportItems||0))])}${group('세무·신고자료','tax',[metric('세무 기본정보',accounting.taxProfiles),metric('부가가치세 보조장부',accounting.vatRecords),metric('지급대상자',accounting.taxPayees),metric(